A live female rabbit. You can right-click it and select "Wring Neck" to kill it and receive a [[Dead Rabbit]].

==How to Acquire==

{{PAGENAME}}s can be found in both deciduous and pine forests.

To catch a rabbit right-click on it to pick it up from the ground. It is recommended to be next to the rabbit before doing so as right-clicking it will cause it to flee from you at running speed. If you have space for a 2x2 item the rabbit will appear in your inventory.

==How to Use==

*[[Animal Husbandry|Animal Husbandry]] enables you to breed rabbits. A [[Rabbit Hutch]], a [[Rabbit Buck]] and a {{PAGENAME}} are required to multiply.
*If killed via combat, it will leave a [[Dead Rabbit]] as its corpse.
*Rabbits hold outside claimed areas require food to not degrade and die. Inside claimed area's they will go dormant.

